NOT A CERTIFIED LIFE-SAFETY DEVICE.

FireProtect is a demonstration and research project. It has not been validated
against UL 217, EN 54 or any other fire-detection standard, and its models are
trained on synthetic data. Do not rely on it in place of a listed smoke alarm
or a professionally installed fire-detection system.
